  "finding": {
    "summary": "The trim makes gbrain accept every provider recall (2,017 -> 2,000 and 3,038 -> 2,000 characters, outcome ok, a ### gbrain block in each stored turn), but no recall returns the told fact: effect.delivery.facts is empty in both cells. gbrain ranks a recall question by its first 12 distinct content words, and in this rig the current message starts with the shared preamble, so those 12 words are preamble words and no saved fact clears the admission floor.",
